# 行尾统一为 LF：消除 Windows 下 core.autocrlf=true 造成的假阳性修改噪音。
# 文本文件统一 LF 存储与检出；二进制文件显式标记，避免被误判为文本。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件：不进行行尾转换。
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
*.pdf binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary
